<!--
  Lantern Song: an original practice melody (Gensing sample), 3/4, quarter = 84, 24 bars in file order.
  More demanding than the other samples:
  - pickup bar (printed 0, ID m1), dotted rhythms, a dotted-eighth + sixteenth, an eighth-note triplet (m6)
  - melisma under a slur on the triplet (only the first note carries a lyric)
  - ties across barlines (m7 -> m8, m20 -> m21) and rests mid-phrase
  - accidentals: F#4 and E natural (G minor colour, m13-m14), Ab4 (m22)
  - key changes: Bb major -> D major (m16) -> Bb major (m21)
  - one grace note (m18, skipped by the ID scheme), dynamics, breath marks, final fermata
  - range D4 to Eb5
-->
